[
 {
  "id": 0,
  "src_sha256": "4090fb25eb5041a040992058221f1211493f6c0a7fd97724f05a07ecfe1041ec",
  "zh": "噓！喂，過來一下。"
 },
 {
  "id": 1,
  "src_sha256": "620d9c1e8bf5ae1bafbc5d6fbde5d26e256cae3165fc5cc6bf30f33480344ae9",
  "zh": "又是你們……"
 },
 {
  "id": 2,
  "src_sha256": "07b08d077b50ab732bb5e8b4f26599688d8dd13005b5b6593fe9526c62e7475f",
  "zh": "我沒什麼好跟你們說的。"
 },
 {
  "id": 3,
  "src_sha256": "645a4ad5c792104bba23076eb6e0b5e73d7dda65497b73306bd470ff48a04591",
  "zh": "喔，拜託，省省吧……"
 },
 {
  "id": 6,
  "src_sha256": "5fee11a7ae3804d6791915b7c3f0fa2163cf94563bc4f7376ec03ad8c8e43c1b",
  "zh": "你們要是想在臉上留個巴掌印，就繼續啊。"
 },
 {
  "id": 7,
  "src_sha256": "5cb6cd6af790f38825a6f161ad8c5185aad28a1ddbf68410a60af11ab485d04b",
  "zh": "想收買 Razuka 哪有這麼便宜，老兄！"
 },
 {
  "id": 8,
  "src_sha256": "3aa3d5bff7f295c7b72a8262e20c189ac31293b94ebc64a927ed2d3f737c62cd",
  "zh": "來啊！快互相殺個你死我活啊！"
 },
 {
  "id": 9,
  "src_sha256": "23b9c802238c655bd6a047d4fded39c4e558f4286e6ff2543ff132ecc06eef48",
  "zh": "我是 Razuka 。除了那位老大（ THE MAN ）以外，我誰都不替他賣命。"
 },
 {
  "id": 12,
  "src_sha256": "0435f95d857269d61a7c8adc7bcd3d9ff618454e875d4577ed74b4a4d50a7ee6",
  "zh": "喔，對。謝啦。"
 },
 {
  "id": 13,
  "src_sha256": "7468605e8146a524adc86c6118c25ad91af0f8d473eed563b2fb0fcbe80c3614",
  "zh": "你們自己的垃圾自己留著，老兄。"
 },
 {
  "id": 14,
  "src_sha256": "0606dacdf32cfeef633853c44c772f2ce8f77af3102497fb8b541b4828e139fe",
  "zh": "你們知道嗎，有錢好像能讓我的記憶活絡（ jog ）起來……"
 },
 {
  "id": 15,
  "src_sha256": "feb859bbea7c89b39b6863c4f39ec4776b4f17d0c745e69793c2bc843a45d09a",
  "zh": "看起來你們現在也沒別的我想要的東西了。"
 },
 {
  "id": 16,
  "src_sha256": "1ec9b26263efc2eedfbb83e4e18a67ae50084586da2a6d64e698363a946a53ee",
  "zh": "拜託！你們這裡根本不夠啦！"
 },
 {
  "id": 17,
  "src_sha256": "85cb144508e3d971828d92a185f77b11de73b1accbf1ed11d6e89a6805c187ac",
  "zh": "喂，你這個小混球！這是我的！"
 },
 {
  "id": 18,
  "src_sha256": "bae9c1aab025fbf08eb60b6f003cd50afd18dca5db65aeeef913c38786ae540f",
  "zh": "你們是想把你們那顆惹麻煩的腦袋給摘掉是不是？"
 },
 {
  "id": 19,
  "src_sha256": "ad970f382f18561a53c33807a3cfe8fc8f28bf252faca0b87e7ae24c6c2b54dc",
  "zh": "我看起來像 Blienmeis 嗎？"
 },
 {
  "id": 20,
  "src_sha256": "5ea338b7e4e459c2bdd03465eb7ebb993cc5ddfc64b8a6e2e8bc7ffec20f546a",
  "zh": "我要把你們的腦袋留著當戰利品！"
 },
 {
  "id": 21,
  "src_sha256": "74b5d04227d3670388f207befab6f94b916d1e8b1b11d419decc9a4bac7e3b15",
  "zh": "我會記得你們……"
 },
 {
  "id": 22,
  "src_sha256": "82ca6a3c2cdda315bff0bd35b4d6d5d1d6ed3a9b9c2a831578c7b25bda4b563c",
  "zh": "我不回答問題……"
 },
 {
  "id": 23,
  "src_sha256": "083e3839a56e326deb9516ada982a64877e69dcade3ae4e9d7e138569b432ac3",
  "zh": "老弟，我自己也才剛到……"
 },
 {
  "id": 24,
  "src_sha256": "797fbca4ed17112de639ea42819afdb71b4272163a09fc67131c9e8c3d9f94c8",
  "zh": "我才不告訴你們……"
 },
 {
  "id": 25,
  "src_sha256": "f7d9846a8826ded66c395b902ba8ccbbae1d3e508d5dbf2a4d088c5ca442e7b6",
  "zh": "記性有問題嗎，老兄？我說過……"
 },
 {
  "id": 26,
  "src_sha256": "acfb7721675e15a5866771c5cb9d561393f61b2c35f8aede43017bbf47010993",
  "zh": "慢點慢點，火箭人（ rocketman ）。呃，你們剛剛說的第一件事是什麼？"
 },
 {
  "id": 27,
  "src_sha256": "4fcecea2cf8855dbf14b5bedb452e4eb4b3a238d35f433b5f128db1caa8488d0",
  "zh": "好，那另一件事……"
 },
 {
  "id": 28,
  "src_sha256": "8e0f2f419c2e76daffbcf122255370e5080600f170cf5256239ba017cfc3e9c9",
  "zh": "是是是。隨便啦……"
 },
 {
  "id": 29,
  "src_sha256": "65d144261c413738fbb2522235c35a32d25b7a33ae12f92d42caefb5771a0452",
  "zh": "我可沒一整天的時間……"
 },
 {
  "id": 30,
  "src_sha256": "238ad678b2e1096640d45cdcd5ae0f4f98600140ff47edab846b5c25ddb43281",
  "zh": "喂，你們有事要做嗎？有就去做啊！"
 },
 {
  "id": 34,
  "src_sha256": "4ca7f7972496b586efb74c234a007005d1c13adac471bac4ba212658cbdb8da4",
  "zh": "你們要是想找地方住，已經被占了。"
 },
 {
  "id": 44,
  "src_sha256": "c99ea7a2102bc785eccf65e4fb1346f545fcccd3234e50b4dfb6aad547895fa3",
  "zh": "他們真是麻煩透頂……"
 },
 {
  "id": 50,
  "src_sha256": "b112abd77606c372549525e0376cb3d693ccccd34e4a11190dfdc514ad95600b",
  "zh": "你們還挺有眼力的嘛，老兄。"
 },
 {
  "id": 53,
  "src_sha256": "d3c3d81eef7a758c0f1227959ba3b16c8ee8b73ac292a88f5b30a8d1e54af7d8",
  "zh": "你們講的是 Guardia ，老兄。我已經跟那邊沒關係了。"
 },
 {
  "id": 54,
  "src_sha256": "8c01fd083dea7afc073ee2d551d8904ab811867e3e598d3eb9c02099c70e7c77",
  "zh": "我的記性在好轉。我給你們的建議是：離那個 Savant 遠一點。我們跟他有筆帳要算。這樣吧。你們想入夥嗎？去 Trynton 找我老大談。當然啦，你們得先過 Milano 那一關……"
 },
 {
  "id": 57,
  "src_sha256": "6b6508cdae3c64933c89e7d723ddb77536e7660b1ed6ec50a2ea9436e41ca7ea",
  "zh": "之前我就不擔心他們，現在也一樣。"
 },
 {
  "id": 66,
  "src_sha256": "c99f435617694292210be1b526f9b3becd14a5e4b3a84683333f3312d33935b0",
  "zh": "你們認識那位老兄（ man ）？那很好。我會跟他說你們要去拜訪。"
 },
 {
  "id": 67,
  "src_sha256": "4d98a1d906a686c7d6523ebaac3835b4396d62fd38f9d1da9f8f33a4f7c4ea49",
  "zh": "好笑，我一聽到那些錢幣的聲音，什麼都想起來了。這個 Astral Dominae ？ Savant 手上有，但他絕對留不住，誰叫他欠我們那麼多錢。不過這不關你們的事……對吧。"
 },
 {
  "id": 72,
  "src_sha256": "e3215093e78c1acae3394856a35afbe1b2917f9c57a69cd46d7723fcea5e8320",
  "zh": "什麼傳聞？我才不管什麼鬼傳聞。"
 },
 {
  "id": 73,
  "src_sha256": "cfb0adbd998e139a7ff73319d5dfae9b7611c516bcee17ea8bf478ae2b73fb6e",
  "zh": "關你們屁事！"
 },
 {
  "id": 75,
  "src_sha256": "a06b068742762184aeccfe663c3af9ca6134c26f8d4a4d563a891c53e4197795",
  "zh": "對，這些和更多的都回敬給你們。"
 },
 {
  "id": 76,
  "src_sha256": "bd69ed80ce605a2fd07b0a9a75da9c947c9e0f311b680928653047aa83892b86",
  "zh": "真有創意。我要是想那樣做，還用得著你們來建議我嗎。"
 },
 {
  "id": 77,
  "src_sha256": "b38a7ba3937ea67b07c0018d26faf476be12a401c3c74346a968c5f264778081",
  "zh": "嗨呀……"
 },
 {
  "id": 78,
  "src_sha256": "52c8b305dbb867c1dcaf87f48223ccaa565ff9ad7ea9804b2fcfd54f043c25b4",
  "zh": "回頭見……"
 },
 {
  "id": 79,
  "src_sha256": "38178a20b470cfd18299fb1593dd4ba706f1a83321dac051d01086efd8b7a96f",
  "zh": "不。"
 },
 {
  "id": 80,
  "src_sha256": "02c4600325e3bdd68539436a3a89f0ea703f476cab0309be4a25ce04d09d7c5a",
  "zh": "我又不是商店，老兄。"
 },
 {
  "id": 81,
  "src_sha256": "c9cf922068d603f6d37ecdb0c7e6c69e61b102248ac51bcdd4dfa729e680e15c",
  "zh": "看我這模樣，比你們好。"
 },
 {
  "id": 82,
  "src_sha256": "b5119081e84cf9458b2b9a1290d34522a494c454ebb5cce75e40e2f6c1df97c1",
  "zh": "幫（ help ）不了你們。"
 },
 {
  "id": 90,
  "src_sha256": "2c54421215ed7df375ee36c2c79fd2cd8a5617f10d9d67cfbf61562381fb5ba9",
  "zh": "不知道。也不想知道。"
 },
 {
  "id": 91,
  "src_sha256": "3a9dd5d821c31311a4aa1da93161813979d629681fcb3e5e97c15440871e9212",
  "zh": "在 Trynton 。"
 },
 {
  "id": 101,
  "src_sha256": "5a7195fc9ddc433b2e10995696c57fe37e072b7b020adeafc0c10db90ac1f028",
  "zh": "就在這裡，你這個該死的白痴。"
 },
 {
  "id": 104,
  "src_sha256": "a38aca9b08e9dd12a8d444fbfc5aeab903c1a8ff0f7e1c32cf7b415685ad8da0",
  "zh": "嘿……你們就是搭那艘船來的那幾個！那降落真精彩。我喝醉了蒙著眼都能降得比你們好。你們這些可憐的船難倖存者大概需要點現金吧，嗯？對工作（ job ）有興趣嗎？"
 },
 {
  "id": 105,
  "src_sha256": "db6d6a50c1b65bc9439e632b137fa8cb47e82ee536f8ade18d3424f4ebe59bf2",
  "zh": "嘿——等一下。我想起來了！老大聽了會笑翻。自從你們在 Guardia 搞出那場把戲，他就一直在找你們算帳。千萬、千萬別惹 Razuka ，我的朋友。不過，你們至少可以來彌補我。對小小的工作（ job ）有興趣嗎？只在你我之間，懂吧。"
 },
 {
  "id": 106,
  "src_sha256": "db1c9ecac9ce56ddb07bc1ebd8467bf714d9ea62cc4900b5a49e48d05ed09cad",
  "zh": "你們有興趣。很好。這件事你們做得漂亮，就拿五成。搞砸了……啊，不過你們不會搞砸的，對吧？好，條件是這樣。"
 },
 {
  "id": 107,
  "src_sha256": "b5f1cba0e783525f4bca37e5ed66ceaa3a3d72d3868015adcd71970e20e0b0c9",
  "zh": "我需要從銀行領一筆，呃，小小的款項，但因為我在那邊惹了點麻煩（ trouble ），自己去不安全。所以，你們拿我的支票去兌現，懂嗎？辦完之後，到 Trynton 來找我，我會付你們酬勞。"
 },
 {
  "id": 108,
  "src_sha256": "477202ab7258744d9f799fa8789a0271376f0bd44f59cc2dc618e575daaa24df",
  "zh": "這樣也好，你們大概會把自己的小臉蛋給轟掉……"
 },
 {
  "id": 109,
  "src_sha256": "dcb8714482f3cd38813a74da8fc8d189ef57ec37189c6c419865bf72e9fd5762",
  "zh": "喔，還有，把這把槍也帶著。路上遇到什麼流氓，它都能幫（ help ）上忙……"
 },
 {
  "id": 110,
  "src_sha256": "588a31c16b05864e2099d28545b7e34d522f84425004c92fcc5e8690576b3df7",
  "zh": "你們對這行是新手，不是嗎。拜託，老兄（ man ）。我需要錢。快去。"
 },
 {
  "id": 111,
  "src_sha256": "6c842952abfb8a98817c96ecff832f31f54c9a2e4dcab16bd87d16b985f890c4",
  "zh": "嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿……一群笨蛋。"
 },
 {
  "id": 112,
  "src_sha256": "8b7fafd5153db8b978200a1c248f97e1ffdb27fd5a76244f56668874ce7436f5",
  "zh": "沒錯，那位老大（ THE MAN ）。你們要是不知道他是誰，我是不會講的。"
 },
 {
  "id": 113,
  "src_sha256": "59e395749714aeda4b34f4f3390b2706049260b998565c74522657a49f651437",
  "zh": "我看起來像保母嗎？我哪會知道他們的事？"
 },
 {
  "id": 114,
  "src_sha256": "9e910dcc7caf2f60a2d10ebb66557c9194683727ff5d9c527a9c731a9c11d4a1",
  "zh": "別跟我說你們沒聽過 Razuka 。你們最好趕快學乖。"
 },
 {
  "id": 115,
  "src_sha256": "74093e67361fc0a0ad5927594574066164a8a95b45a36b63678d3996bd8e6796",
  "zh": "閉嘴！"
 },
 {
  "id": 116,
  "src_sha256": "4e462d6635591d7ab00fb84070859ce73a5237a4a5391e34c549c8d3f139e576",
  "zh": "那是讓我世界運轉的東西，老兄。"
 },
 {
  "id": 117,
  "src_sha256": "7127a09b7e8f4798e6c49dddb5ef75bbd0290bea5a8523f3d09e5da33b229f44",
  "zh": "對啦，有幾個大塊頭惡霸（ bullies ）想整我，懂嗎？我在 Arnika 就是不安全。"
 },
 {
  "id": 118,
  "src_sha256": "c2e475719ed5f5c1e06e5833c43b91d17ae0a5d39e362ce91c3b45ec76f55102",
  "zh": "就在 Arnika 。你們不會找不到的。"
 },
 {
  "id": 119,
  "src_sha256": "384b56994a2fe81162212b41b9416ccf9362e0bf9e626515420b75ef7cf8a66d",
  "zh": "你們聽到我說的了，老兄！"
 },
 {
  "id": 120,
  "src_sha256": "0e1afb700219638fbc3be7e75e230ef90db87dfe0154f6156e96a3f46ebb5961",
  "zh": "這裡往北，老兄。"
 },
 {
  "id": 121,
  "src_sha256": "86e42918cdc6452094276e6174cdd0cffb107b47abff6f8d77d6f3284614e93a",
  "zh": "把你們的屁股往南挪。"
 },
 {
  "id": 122,
  "src_sha256": "7ff4c440d99d29205db2955c8443b7e18eab155f078941f1969319c42377776d",
  "zh": "那是東邊。"
 },
 {
  "id": 123,
  "src_sha256": "3b95b0023fb373c081bbc6eacea2a7a0b61e5915f90fb2eb953cfdebacf53a08",
  "zh": "你們明明知道那是西邊。"
 }
]
